1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-First Episode
The Magic Cookies

15
00:02:04,021 --> 00:02:06,819
It's time to wake up
Prince Sapphire.

16
00:02:07,581 --> 00:02:09,651
Prince Sapphire!

17
00:02:10,301 --> 00:02:12,257
It's time to get up!

18
00:02:14,501 --> 00:02:16,059
Good heavens!

19
00:02:21,541 --> 00:02:25,329
Prince, it is time to go to the
secret room for your lessons!

20
00:02:25,381 --> 00:02:27,212
Yes, Garigori, I know!

21
00:02:33,901 --> 00:02:36,176
I will be back soon!

22
00:02:36,221 --> 00:02:39,497
No, Sapphire! You must
study at least until nine o'clock!

23
00:02:55,701 --> 00:02:58,295
You are very late
this morning, Sapphire.

24
00:02:58,341 --> 00:03:02,220
Put this dress on right
away. I will help you. There!

25
00:03:03,221 --> 00:03:06,736
Is this the dress that my
mother had prepared for me?

26
00:03:06,781 --> 00:03:10,296
Yes, it is. You must take
cooking and sewing lessons...

27
00:03:10,341 --> 00:03:13,174
...to be able to become as
good as your dear mother.

28
00:03:13,341 --> 00:03:15,491
Alright, I will take the lessons.

29
00:03:15,541 --> 00:03:18,294
But I can't go horseback
riding in this dress!

30
00:03:18,581 --> 00:03:21,698
You would appreciate it more if
you behaved more like a woman.

31
00:03:21,861 --> 00:03:24,421
- Let me help you!
- No, I don't want to!

32
00:03:24,461 --> 00:03:26,292
- Come on!
- I want to do it myself!

33
00:03:29,021 --> 00:03:31,012
How pretty you are...

34
00:03:32,541 --> 00:03:35,658
Now, to start,
slice this bread.

35
00:03:35,861 --> 00:03:38,455
I can't do it! I don't know how!

36
00:03:38,501 --> 00:03:42,289
If you warm up the knife, you'll
be able to slice it more easily.

37
00:03:42,341 --> 00:03:44,536
Like this, look! Like this!

38
00:03:45,221 --> 00:03:47,496
- Chop! Chop! Chop!
- I understand.

39
00:03:52,741 --> 00:03:55,380
I don't know how to do it!
I don't know how to cut it well!

40
00:03:55,821 --> 00:03:57,812
Don't you have a knife
that's a bit longer?

41
00:03:57,861 --> 00:04:00,375
See if you can do better
with this.

42
00:04:01,021 --> 00:04:04,013
- Good! This one works!
- Be careful not to cut yourself.

43
00:04:04,061 --> 00:04:06,370
- It's very sharp.
- Really?

44
00:04:07,101 --> 00:04:10,138
My God, Princess!
What do you want to do?!

45
00:04:10,181 --> 00:04:11,819
Sapphire!

46
00:04:13,901 --> 00:04:16,335
Great! This cuts much better!

47
00:04:17,261 --> 00:04:20,537
But when you cook,
you must use the right tools

48
00:04:20,581 --> 00:04:23,778
- All right...
- Good morning, everyone

49
00:04:24,861 --> 00:04:28,137
- Good morning, Your Majesty!
- Did you sleep well?

50
00:04:28,181 --> 00:04:30,615
But tell me:
who is that girl?

51
00:04:32,741 --> 00:04:36,017
Good heavens!
But you really are Sapphire!

52
00:04:36,101 --> 00:04:38,217
Yes! Here is breakfast!

53
00:04:38,261 --> 00:04:40,650
You are really very good.

54
00:04:41,061 --> 00:04:44,019
Here you go, father!
And you are served too, mother!

55
00:04:44,061 --> 00:04:46,416
You really are
a beautiful and good girl!

56
00:04:46,701 --> 00:04:49,010
I can do everything,
if I only try.

57
00:04:50,781 --> 00:04:53,420
What's wrong? What's happening?
Why are you shouting?

58
00:04:53,501 --> 00:04:56,015
Nothing, nothing...
Don't worry.

59
00:04:56,061 --> 00:04:59,019
How messy you are!
I had arranged them so well!

60
00:04:59,061 --> 00:05:02,292
Yes, I'm sorry... Do you want to spread
the tablecloth now?

61
00:05:02,781 --> 00:05:04,533
What?... Ah, this one!

62
00:05:05,741 --> 00:05:07,891
I am so sorry, father.

63
00:05:07,941 --> 00:05:10,774
Yes, I forgive you, but
hurry up, please, Sapphire!

64
00:05:15,701 --> 00:05:19,330
All things considered, it would have been
better if you were born a boy, you know?

65
00:05:24,821 --> 00:05:26,732
Why so early?

66
00:05:26,781 --> 00:05:28,692
Well, I wanted to tell you that...

67
00:05:29,141 --> 00:05:31,416
- Really?!
- Yes, sir!

68
00:05:31,461 --> 00:05:34,055
This is the pastry!
Stand up straight!

69
00:05:34,621 --> 00:05:37,260
Do a somersault! Bark!

70
00:05:38,901 --> 00:05:41,620
I put the medicine in
it that forces people...

71
00:05:41,661 --> 00:05:44,221
..to obey any order!

72
00:05:44,261 --> 00:05:47,014
Good! Have many pastries made immediately!

73
00:05:47,061 --> 00:05:49,575
And make sure the King, the
Queen and Sapphire eat them today,

74
00:05:49,621 --> 00:05:52,738
during afternoon tea,
together with the other pastries!

75
00:05:52,781 --> 00:05:54,373
Splendid!

76
00:05:55,821 --> 00:05:57,493
Really good!

77
00:05:57,941 --> 00:05:59,852
Why did you eat
my pastry?

78
00:06:00,621 --> 00:06:04,296
The pastries force people
to obey any order.

79
00:06:04,941 --> 00:06:07,171
Where are you going, damn parrot?

80
00:06:07,221 --> 00:06:09,291
I ate it! I ate it!

81
00:06:09,341 --> 00:06:11,696
It's time you dressed again
as a boy.

82
00:06:11,741 --> 00:06:13,697
Ah, finally! Right away!

83
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:16,013
Here I am!

84
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:18,859
We wanted to raise her
as a boy...

85
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:21,572
...and now she's a tomboy!

86
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:28,017
Hey, parrot! Halt!

87
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:30,851
Strange, it stopped all of a sudden!

88
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:33,257
Now come onto my hand.

89
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:36,095
This must be
Nylon's parrot.

90
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:39,178
Hey, my parrot!
My little parrot!

91
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:43,217
- Oh, Prince!
- Is it yours? I'll give it back to you right away.

92
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:46,015
It doesn't matter,
I'll take it back later.

93
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:48,336
Now I have to take
a long walk! Long!

94
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:52,458
How strange...! There's something
wrong with this parrot.

95
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,577
Listen, tell me everything you know

96
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:58,897
- If you eat those pastries...
- What happens?

97
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:01,978
- Have some pastries made!
- Make some pastries?

98
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,489
But what pastries
are you talking about?!

99
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:12,540
Duralumin! This parrot
talked about pastries...

100
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:15,493
...that force people
to obey any order!

101
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:19,813
Pastries that force you
to obey orders?!

102
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,852
What the hell is this about?!

103
00:07:21,900 --> 00:07:23,812
Nylon, do you know anything about this?

104
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:26,136
I don't know anything about
it. What are you talking about?

105
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:29,254
You're lying! A moment
ago it seemed like you knew!

106
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:34,935
But what the hell is happening to you?

107
00:07:34,980 --> 00:07:37,290
It seems like you had
a horrible dream!

108
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:41,900
I'm sure they will use
those pastries...

109
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:43,897
..for some conspiracy of theirs

110
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:47,690
The pastries will surely be made
in some pastry shop.

111
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:49,898
I'll manage to find it.

112
00:07:58,020 --> 00:08:00,410
You are Prince Sapphire, right?

113
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:03,294
- Where are you going?
- There's a pastry shop.

114
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,616
...in the woods!
I'm going to see it!

115
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:09,569
We are also going to the woods
to see it!

116
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:38,617
The walls are made
of sponge cake!

117
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:40,697
The snow on the roof is whipped cream!

118
00:08:45,181 --> 00:08:48,298
The pebbles made of popcorn
are delicious!

119
00:08:48,461 --> 00:08:52,739
- Delicious!
- What a beautiful, delicious place!

120
00:08:53,021 --> 00:08:55,330
Hey, you!

121
00:08:55,701 --> 00:08:58,295
Go away, you damn kids

122
00:08:58,381 --> 00:09:01,453
I have to make some pastries
that were ordered,

123
00:09:01,501 --> 00:09:05,892
so get out of my way
and let me work in peace!

124
00:09:08,021 --> 00:09:12,219
Ordered... Just as I thought! It's
likely they are having them made here.

125
00:09:14,501 --> 00:09:18,289
Opal, go to the castle and bring me
my girl's dress right away.

126
00:09:23,381 --> 00:09:26,657
This will do!
You, Opal, wait for me here

127
00:09:35,261 --> 00:09:37,695
Who is disturbing me?
I'm busy, for heaven's sake!

128
00:09:37,741 --> 00:09:39,618
Are you a customer?

129
00:09:40,421 --> 00:09:42,218
No, I want to work.

130
00:09:42,261 --> 00:09:44,252
I heard that the pastry chef...

131
00:09:44,301 --> 00:09:47,179
...needed someone to
help him with his work.

132
00:09:47,741 --> 00:09:50,380
So, can you let
me work with you?

133
00:09:51,541 --> 00:09:54,009
Today I have so much
to do that I'll take you on.

134
00:09:54,101 --> 00:09:56,012
How kind!

135
00:09:56,261 --> 00:09:59,253
Do you make pastries
in such a small room?

136
00:09:59,661 --> 00:10:03,540
No! Do you perhaps think I can
make pastries inside pastries? Come!

137
00:10:05,421 --> 00:10:08,811
Good heavens! There's
a room underground!

138
00:10:21,301 --> 00:10:24,099
What a great place
to work! It's fantastic!

139
00:10:24,141 --> 00:10:27,417
Of course, since I am the
best pastry chef in the world!

140
00:10:28,461 --> 00:10:30,258
Hey, you!

141
00:10:31,661 --> 00:10:33,060
yes?

142
00:10:33,101 --> 00:10:35,251
Go and light the fire
in that oven, over there!

143
00:10:35,301 --> 00:10:36,939
- Come on!
- Yes!

144
00:10:37,861 --> 00:10:40,580
Well, lighting a fire
is super easy.

145
00:10:43,381 --> 00:10:45,337
Good heavens!

146
00:10:45,901 --> 00:10:49,211
Hey! Don't you even know how to
light a fire?!

147
00:10:49,261 --> 00:10:51,821
I'm sorry,
but this wood is wet!

148
00:10:51,861 --> 00:10:54,136
You've turned...
black as coal...

149
00:10:54,181 --> 00:10:57,014
...even the pastry dough! It's ruined!

150
00:10:57,061 --> 00:10:59,894
Then we won't be able to
make the pastries anymore!

151
00:10:59,941 --> 00:11:02,057
Oh, yes! I will make them at all costs!

152
00:11:02,101 --> 00:11:04,331
Before tea time!
You clean everything up!

153
00:11:04,381 --> 00:11:05,655
Yes!

154
00:11:18,941 --> 00:11:22,297
Now I'll put in the medicine
that I was ordered to.

155
00:11:30,461 --> 00:11:32,850
Now come here to help me

156
00:11:33,021 --> 00:11:37,412
Take a nice handful of dough
and shape the pastry.

157
00:11:37,461 --> 00:11:39,417
Afterward, I will put it in the oven.

158
00:11:40,141 --> 00:11:42,018
Like this.

159
00:11:42,261 --> 00:11:44,252
My God, it's too big!

160
00:11:53,741 --> 00:11:56,175
But how misshapen mine are!

161
00:11:56,541 --> 00:12:00,136
There's no need for you to make
any more. Put mine in the oven.

162
00:12:00,341 --> 00:12:02,013
Yes!

163
00:12:02,061 --> 00:12:06,498
I've got it! I will mess up on purpose
and drop all the pastries!

164
00:12:07,581 --> 00:12:10,539
Stupid! Why don't you
try to be more careful?

165
00:12:10,581 --> 00:12:13,141
I'm so sorry, Mr. Pastry Chef!

166
00:12:13,181 --> 00:12:16,537
How come you aren't capable
of doing such a simple job?

167
00:12:16,581 --> 00:12:20,893
Even a child could do it!
Can't you be less distracted?

168
00:12:20,941 --> 00:12:22,533
Hey, boss!

169
00:12:23,221 --> 00:12:25,451
Boss, did you make the pastries?

170
00:12:25,501 --> 00:12:28,891
I'm baking them right
now! Just wait a moment.

171
00:12:28,941 --> 00:12:30,613
Who is that girl?

172
00:12:31,381 --> 00:12:33,815
She's my assistant.
They are done now.

173
00:12:33,861 --> 00:12:36,455
- Come here and help me, come on!
- I'm coming!

174
00:12:37,181 --> 00:12:40,093
Great! Thank you,
Mr. Pastry Chef.

175
00:12:40,141 --> 00:12:42,018
Anyway, I have a question to ask:

176
00:12:42,061 --> 00:12:44,256
What is this medicine
that I put in the pastries?

177
00:12:44,301 --> 00:12:46,212
It's not poison, is it?

178
00:12:46,261 --> 00:12:49,936
- Oh, no! Only Vitamin C.
- I don't believe it!

179
00:12:52,621 --> 00:12:55,215
Hey, you! Why did you
say "I don't believe it"?

180
00:12:55,261 --> 00:12:57,013
Do you know something
about these pastries?

181
00:12:57,061 --> 00:13:00,371
Not me... I... I don't know
anything about this medicine.

182
00:13:02,541 --> 00:13:05,294
These pastries are
really very good.

183
00:13:07,101 --> 00:13:10,810
I see...! Then you will
eat these pastries...

184
00:13:10,861 --> 00:13:13,421
...in which Vitamin C
has been put! Eat them!

185
00:13:13,461 --> 00:13:15,577
Eat them! Eat them now!

186
00:13:15,621 --> 00:13:18,089
Try eating them! Come on, eat them!

187
00:13:24,941 --> 00:13:28,820
Eat them, come on! Come
on! I order you to eat them!

188
00:13:32,261 --> 00:13:35,173
Get her! That girl
knows about the pastries!

189
00:13:35,221 --> 00:13:38,418
Don't let her
escape! Go, quickly!

190
00:13:38,461 --> 00:13:39,814
Yes!

191
00:13:40,061 --> 00:13:42,621
Stop! Stop!

192
00:13:45,621 --> 00:13:47,498
Opal, let's go!

193
00:13:47,541 --> 00:13:49,736
- Stop! Stop!
- Stop!

194
00:14:06,021 --> 00:14:08,137
Who ordered these
pastries from you?

195
00:14:08,181 --> 00:14:10,695
Tell me! Who ordered
these pastries from you?

196
00:14:10,741 --> 00:14:13,209
Fine! If you don't want to
tell me, it doesn't matter!

197
00:14:13,261 --> 00:14:15,138
I'm taking them with me anyway!

198
00:14:15,701 --> 00:14:17,498
And now go!

199
00:14:23,701 --> 00:14:26,454
Mr. Pastry Chef, please
give me those pastries!

200
00:14:26,501 --> 00:14:28,617
So you weren't a girl!

201
00:14:28,661 --> 00:14:31,380
No, no! I will deliver them
to the man who ordered them from me!

202
00:14:31,421 --> 00:14:34,458
I've decided to take them!
You'd better give them to me!

203
00:14:34,701 --> 00:14:38,011
No, absolutely not!
I absolutely cannot give them to you!

204
00:14:41,341 --> 00:14:44,651
- What happened?
- I couldn't get them, sir.

205
00:14:44,701 --> 00:14:48,455
What do you mean?! Perhaps the pastry chef
hadn't made them yet?

206
00:14:48,501 --> 00:14:50,617
What?!
Prince Sapphire came?!

207
00:14:50,661 --> 00:14:52,538
Damn it!

208
00:14:58,501 --> 00:15:00,332
Here I am, Mr. Nylon!

209
00:15:00,381 --> 00:15:02,133
I don't want to hear anything more about Sapphire!

210
00:15:02,181 --> 00:15:05,059
Go back there and this time
take the pastries!

211
00:15:05,101 --> 00:15:06,614
Yes, sir!

212
00:15:06,661 --> 00:15:09,459
And do whatever you want
with Prince Sapphire!

213
00:15:31,101 --> 00:15:33,012
Let's go!

214
00:15:38,301 --> 00:15:40,292
I've come to take those pastries!

215
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:44,338
Damn you!

216
00:15:55,821 --> 00:15:58,016
You won't be able to stop me anyway!

217
00:15:58,421 --> 00:16:00,810
I did it! I did it!

218
00:16:02,821 --> 00:16:05,210
Well done!
And now deal with Sapphire!

219
00:16:12,021 --> 00:16:16,333
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!
I am the pastry chef! Don't shoot!

220
00:16:17,101 --> 00:16:19,569
But why do you want to kill me?

221
00:16:20,821 --> 00:16:23,016
I don't want you to tell
anyone anything about the pastries,

222
00:16:23,061 --> 00:16:25,655
so, to silence you,
I will kill you.

223
00:16:28,021 --> 00:16:31,093
Good heavens! Dirty cowards!
They tricked me!

224
00:16:31,141 --> 00:16:34,292
I assure you that I didn't know
that that medicine was poisonous!

225
00:16:34,341 --> 00:16:38,220
I didn't know! I only obeyed
by making those pastries.

226
00:16:38,421 --> 00:16:41,094
And do you know who they want
to eat them?

227
00:16:41,141 --> 00:16:44,258
As far as I know, they want
everyone at the castle to eat them:

228
00:16:44,301 --> 00:16:47,020
the King, the Queen, the Prince...
In short, everyone!

229
00:16:47,061 --> 00:16:49,780
Oh, my God!
I forgot something important:

230
00:16:49,821 --> 00:16:52,540
they will be eaten during tea
this afternoon!

231
00:16:53,821 --> 00:16:57,018
What?!
But tea time will be here soon!

232
00:16:58,141 --> 00:17:01,611
Fortunately, there is still a
whole package of pastries left!

233
00:17:03,621 --> 00:17:06,533
I'll try to get those men
out there to eat them.

234
00:17:07,341 --> 00:17:10,219
That way, they will be
as obedient as that parrot!

235
00:17:19,021 --> 00:17:20,852
Eat this!

236
00:17:29,781 --> 00:17:32,659
Listen well, you who
have eaten my pastries!

237
00:17:32,701 --> 00:17:35,295
Now there is no more
need for you to hunt me!

238
00:17:35,661 --> 00:17:37,891
- Yes, sir!
- See?

239
00:17:37,941 --> 00:17:40,694
The pastry medicine
has taken effect.

240
00:17:40,741 --> 00:17:42,413
Fantastic!

241
00:17:45,661 --> 00:17:47,617
Prince, we won't get in your way anymore!

242
00:17:47,661 --> 00:17:51,654
Now you must tell me who it was
who ordered you to kill me!

243
00:17:52,021 --> 00:17:54,410
I don't know his name.
I didn't even see him,

244
00:17:54,461 --> 00:17:56,372
because he gave the order
to our leader.

245
00:17:57,021 --> 00:17:59,012
Is there anyone who knows?

246
00:17:59,821 --> 00:18:03,177
Prince, hurry up
and return to the castle!

247
00:18:03,221 --> 00:18:05,291
- I'm going!
- And you, get out of here!

248
00:18:05,341 --> 00:18:07,901
Never return to this forest again!
I order you!

249
00:18:20,821 --> 00:18:24,097
- But at least are they good?
- They are delicious.

250
00:18:24,581 --> 00:18:27,812
I had them made
by the best pastry chef in town.

251
00:18:27,981 --> 00:18:30,336
Good! Now deliver them to the servants!

252
00:18:30,381 --> 00:18:33,373
Make sure that everyone who
is close to Sapphire eats them.

253
00:18:33,421 --> 00:18:34,820
Yes, sir.

254
00:18:34,861 --> 00:18:37,933
I hope you have killed
the man who made them.

255
00:18:37,981 --> 00:18:40,779
They are killing him now,
along with Sapphire.

256
00:18:40,821 --> 00:18:42,698
What? Along with Sapphire?!

257
00:18:42,741 --> 00:18:45,938
Are you sure they can manage
to kill him? Sapphire is strong!

258
00:18:46,581 --> 00:18:48,572
I am absolutely sure they will!

259
00:18:49,421 --> 00:18:51,696
Then I will carry out
a plan of mine.

260
00:18:52,901 --> 00:18:55,176
Special troops! Special troops!

261
00:18:55,221 --> 00:18:58,099
Duralumin orders you to kill
the King and his family!

262
00:19:08,821 --> 00:19:12,291
The medicine calmed those wild
men in a second!

263
00:19:12,461 --> 00:19:15,214
If Mom and Dad
take that horrible medicine,

264
00:19:15,261 --> 00:19:18,094
they will be forever obedient
to Grand Duke Duralumin!

265
00:19:19,301 --> 00:19:21,212
Your Majesty, it's tea time

266
00:19:21,261 --> 00:19:23,821
Put everything on the table
and call the others.

267
00:19:23,941 --> 00:19:25,932
We will have tea all together.

268
00:19:26,221 --> 00:19:27,734
Yes, Your Majesty.

269
00:19:56,301 --> 00:19:58,417
That's a tank!

270
00:20:02,341 --> 00:20:04,411
Gunpowder arrows!

271
00:20:10,821 --> 00:20:13,016
Get them, Opal! Get them!

272
00:20:27,861 --> 00:20:30,375
Stop, or I will kill you!

273
00:20:35,021 --> 00:20:37,171
Who gave you
the order to kill me?

274
00:20:37,221 --> 00:20:39,894
We were ordered
by our Captain, sir!

275
00:20:39,941 --> 00:20:43,217
Don't lie, soldier! It must have
been an order from Duralumin!

276
00:20:43,261 --> 00:20:45,013
- I don't know!
- Opal!

277
00:20:45,061 --> 00:20:47,336
Let the horse
go!

278
00:20:49,261 --> 00:20:52,617
- You will return on foot.
- Very well, sir.

279
00:20:53,901 --> 00:20:56,699
- Aren't they coming?
- They will arrive soon, Your Majesty

280
00:20:56,741 --> 00:20:59,209
- In the meantime, eat.
- No, I will wait for them.

281
00:20:59,261 --> 00:21:01,729
These pastries
look delicious.

282
00:21:06,621 --> 00:21:09,215
- I apologize for the delay.
- Forgive me, Your Majesty.

283
00:21:09,661 --> 00:21:12,733
It doesn't matter.
Anyway, you are always late.

284
00:21:22,181 --> 00:21:25,890
Prince Sapphire has arrived!
Open the gates at once!

285
00:21:30,781 --> 00:21:33,579
What are you doing?
Open immediately!

286
00:21:33,621 --> 00:21:35,771
These pastries
look delicious.

287
00:21:35,821 --> 00:21:37,539
- Don't you think?
- Yes.

288
00:21:37,581 --> 00:21:40,698
I wonder if Sapphire will ever be
able to make ones just like them.

289
00:21:40,741 --> 00:21:43,892
Prince Sapphire, one day,
will make even better ones!

290
00:22:14,381 --> 00:22:16,736
Sapphire, what the hell is going on?!

291
00:22:16,821 --> 00:22:20,018
Father, mother, forgive
me if I had to act this way.

292
00:22:20,061 --> 00:22:23,815
- Those pastries were poisoned!
- Good heavens! Really?

293
00:22:23,861 --> 00:22:26,933
What happened, Sapphire?
Tell me everything, please.

294
00:22:27,501 --> 00:22:29,014
Right away.

295
00:22:29,181 --> 00:22:31,820
But I cannot accuse anyone
of having ordered them,

296
00:22:31,861 --> 00:22:33,658
because I lack the proof.

297
00:22:35,021 --> 00:22:36,739
So, Nylon?

298
00:22:36,781 --> 00:22:38,692
Sapphire has managed
to get on his side...

299
00:22:38,741 --> 00:22:41,175
...our accomplices,
with the help of those pastries.

300
00:22:41,301 --> 00:22:43,212
Idiot!

301
00:22:53,821 --> 00:22:58,133
Maybe I overcooked them, but I'm
sure they must be delicious!

302
00:22:58,901 --> 00:23:02,257
Not bad...
Really not bad!

303
00:23:02,301 --> 00:23:04,815
You wouldn't tell
that it's the first time you've made them.

304
00:23:04,861 --> 00:23:07,329
I'm glad
that they turned out well.

305
00:23:08,821 --> 00:23:10,698
But it tastes bad! It's bitter!

306
00:23:12,261 --> 00:23:15,776
Sapphire, you will manage to do
everything that girls do.

307
00:23:15,821 --> 00:23:17,812
With a little effort,
you will learn to make...

308
00:23:17,861 --> 00:23:20,056
...even the most delicious
sweets in the world.

309
00:23:20,661 --> 00:23:23,733
Do you really believe
that I will learn to cook, father?

310
00:24:08,701 --> 00:24:12,321
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

311
